WHAT?

1038
00:38:53,331 --> 00:38:55,533
-No!
-The cabbage isn't what's important.

1039
00:38:56,000 --> 00:38:57,368
CLAPPING AT THE SAME TIME

1040
00:38:57,435 --> 00:38:59,470
-The garnish.
-Serve it as the garnish!

1041
00:38:59,537 --> 00:39:02,039
It's okay! Don't put it in.

1042
00:39:02,106 --> 00:39:03,507
What cabbage? You don't need it.

1043
00:39:03,574 --> 00:39:06,277
Garnish. Yes.
It was supposed to be a garnish.

1044
00:39:06,477 --> 00:39:08,112
SHUSH

1045
00:39:08,179 --> 00:39:09,647
-Okay.
-Put it on the side.

1046
00:39:10,548 --> 00:39:11,549
My mixing bowl.

1047
00:39:11,615 --> 00:39:12,450
IN GREAT HASTE

1048
00:39:12,516 --> 00:39:15,152
But it's burning. The cabbage's burning.

1049
00:39:15,219 --> 00:39:16,787
THE "IT'S BURNING" ATTACK

1050
00:39:16,854 --> 00:39:18,689
This is so hectic.

1051
00:39:18,756 --> 00:39:20,791
If it gets too rowdy,
throw something at him.

1052
00:39:21,025 --> 00:39:22,226
AND QUIET POONG DOWN

1053
00:39:22,293 --> 00:39:23,561
I forgot to grill the corn.

1054
00:39:23,627 --> 00:39:24,762
Oh, my gosh.

1055
00:39:24,829 --> 00:39:27,098
CORN RIBS ON THE GRIDIRON

1056
00:39:27,164 --> 00:39:28,766
You have three long minutes left.

1057
00:39:28,833 --> 00:39:30,968
-Two minutes and fifty seconds.
-Two minutes and fifty seconds.

1058
00:39:31,035 --> 00:39:33,404
It seems like Jong-won has the advantage.

1059
00:39:33,771 --> 00:39:36,073
DICED RED ONION & PEPPER

1060
00:39:36,474 --> 00:39:37,942
TOMATO PASTE, MINCED GARLIC

1061
00:39:38,008 --> 00:39:39,744
WHITE WINE, LEMON JUICE

1062
00:39:39,810 --> 00:39:42,246
TOMATO SAUCE FOR THE ZUCCHINI

1063
00:39:42,646 --> 00:39:44,348
TIME TO CHECK ON THE ZUCCHINI!

1064
