5. TOP ZUCCHINI WITH BURRATA
AND SLICED CHEESE, TOAST IN OVEN

1065
00:39:51,522 --> 00:39:52,990
Jong-won looks relaxed.

1066
00:39:53,057 --> 00:39:55,793
-I'm not particularly relaxed.
-You aren't?

1067
00:39:55,860 --> 00:39:57,161
What's this?

1068
00:39:57,228 --> 00:40:00,131
I made it so she can enjoy the flavors

1069
00:40:00,197 --> 00:40:01,999
from Spain, France, and Italy.

1070
00:40:02,066 --> 00:40:03,701
-The flavor of Europe.
-European flavor.

1071
00:40:03,768 --> 00:40:05,336
-European flavor.
-European flavor.

1072
00:40:05,403 --> 00:40:07,772
Will Jung-hwa's world tour be a success?

1073
00:40:07,838 --> 00:40:09,006
Will it be a success?

1074
00:40:10,608 --> 00:40:11,976
-Huh?
-Huh?

1075
00:40:12,042 --> 00:40:14,945
-It's a bit unfamiliar.
-It's unfamiliar?

1076
00:40:15,513 --> 00:40:16,781
<i>Is it a new land?</i>

1077
00:40:17,481 --> 00:40:19,517
-But it's good.
-I'm so curious.

1078
00:40:20,084 --> 00:40:22,553
He's now making Caipirinha.

1079
00:40:23,020 --> 00:40:24,488
POUNDING THE LIMES

1080
00:40:24,555 --> 00:40:25,923
LIQUOR

1081
00:40:25,990 --> 00:40:27,525
ALLULOSE

1082
00:40:27,591 --> 00:40:30,661
He extracted the juice from the limes.

1083
00:40:30,861 --> 00:40:33,731
THE OIL IS MUCH HOTTER THAN BEFORE

1084
00:40:33,798 --> 00:40:35,833
It's fine now. Okay.

1085
00:40:35,900 --> 00:40:37,635
It's fine. Even better, actually.

1086
00:40:37,701 --> 00:40:39,236
-It won't pop.
-Even better.

1087
00:40:39,303 --> 00:40:41,038
You still have two minutes.

1088
00:40:41,105 --> 00:40:42,106
You can do it!

1089
00:40:42,173 --> 00:40:43,574
I can do this!

1090
00:40:43,641 --> 00:40:45,142
He's making a Caipirinha.

1091
00:40:45,342 --> 00:40:46,911
RED SHISO, SPARKLING WATER

1092
00:40:47,178 --> 00:40:49,079
ICE

1093
00:40:49,146 --> 00:40:50,080
That looks good.

1094
00:40:50,147 --> 00:40:53,417
-It's more fun to watch this side.
-Right? The helter-skelter side is fun.

1095
00:40:53,484 --> 00:40:55,319
-He seems lost.
-Yes, and in haste.

1096
