-Oh, no. Forty seconds.
-Does it make you go, "<i>Yareu</i>"?

1106
00:41:17,541 --> 00:41:19,009
<i>Yarrrrreu!</i>

1107
00:41:19,410 --> 00:41:21,145
TOTALLY YAREU!

1108
00:41:21,212 --> 00:41:23,881
-The sauce is really good!
<i>-Yarrreu!</i>

1109
00:41:23,948 --> 00:41:25,683
I can't have only the sauce be good.

1110
00:41:25,749 --> 00:41:27,785
Everything else should be too,
