00:41:49,306 --> 00:41:51,642
ZUCCHINI STEAK, GROUND PEPPER

1121
00:41:51,709 --> 00:41:54,545
Thirty seconds.

1122
00:41:54,612 --> 00:41:56,113
You'd better finish up, Jong-won.

1123
00:41:56,180 --> 00:41:57,348
SERVED WITH ROMANESCO BROCCOLI!

1124
00:41:57,414 --> 00:41:59,416
What about this one?
I hope it cooks faster.

1125
00:41:59,483 --> 00:42:02,219
-It's already cooked.
-Oh, no.

1126
00:42:02,286 --> 00:42:04,154
-Twenty seconds.
-Okay.

1127
00:42:04,221 --> 00:42:06,056
-Twenty seconds.
-It's okay. The filling is cooked.

1128
00:42:06,123 --> 00:42:08,259
-Right away.
-Fifteen seconds.

1129
00:42:08,325 --> 00:42:10,728
-Ten seconds.
-No salt?

1130
00:42:10,794 --> 00:42:12,429
-Not necessary.
-Eight.

1131
00:42:12,863 --> 00:42:14,932
PLATING THE CORN RIBS

1132
00:42:15,199 --> 00:42:16,634
JONG-WON GRABS THE STEAMER

1133
00:42:16,700 --> 00:42:18,035
Nine.

1134
00:42:18,102 --> 00:42:20,237
-My gosh.
-Eight. Seven.

1135
00:42:20,504 --> 00:42:23,173
PLATING THE CORN BEOMURI TOO

1136
00:42:23,240 --> 00:42:24,909
-Four. Three.
-Four. Three.

1137
00:42:24,975 --> 00:42:27,278
-Two. One.
-Two. One.

1138
00:42:27,344 --> 00:42:30,314
-Take the dumpling out.
-Jong-won finishes first.

1139
00:42:30,548 --> 00:42:32,016
WHAT ABOUT YONG-WOOK?

1140
00:42:32,249 --> 00:42:36,153
HE ONLY NEEDS TO TAKE THE DUMPLING OUT

1141
00:42:37,655 --> 00:42:39,023
The wrapper's cooked.

1142
00:42:39,089 --> 00:42:42,026
-It just hasn't been browned.
-All the veggies inside are cooked.

1143
00:42:42,092 --> 00:42:44,895
