-Goodness.

1144
00:42:45,129 --> 00:42:46,764
APPLAUSE

1145
00:42:47,097 --> 00:42:48,666
IN TATTERS…

1146
00:42:49,233 --> 00:42:51,569
-That was so much fun.
-It was.

1147
00:42:51,635 --> 00:42:52,903
Great job.

1148
00:42:52,970 --> 00:42:54,071
A BIG HUG

1149
00:42:54,605 --> 00:42:58,142
That cocktail looks so good. My gosh.

1150
00:42:59,143 --> 00:43:00,778
It's so pretty.

1151
00:43:00,844 --> 00:43:03,380
-Anyway, that was so cool.
-It was.

1152
00:43:03,447 --> 00:43:07,351
And now, both meals
were finished for Jung-hwa.

1153
00:43:07,618 --> 00:43:09,053
WOW♥

1154
00:43:09,119 --> 00:43:10,654
Okay, Land.

1155
00:43:10,721 --> 00:43:13,657
-It's so pretty.
-Jong-won finished first.

1156
00:43:13,724 --> 00:43:16,360
-South America, Europe, Korea, <i>Yaho.</i>
<i>-Yaho.</i>

1157
00:43:16,794 --> 00:43:19,997
SOUTH AMERICAN FLAVOR, WATERMELON CEVICHE

1158
00:43:20,698 --> 00:43:23,467
EUROPEAN FLAVOR, ZUCCHINI STEAK

1159
00:43:24,368 --> 00:43:26,604
KOREAN FLAVOR, SUPERSWEET CORN BEOMURI

1160
00:43:27,571 --> 00:43:30,941
CHEF SON JONG-WON'S
SOUTH AMERICA, EUROPE, KOREA, YAHO

1161
00:43:31,008 --> 00:43:32,343
Where should she begin?

1162
00:43:32,409 --> 00:43:34,445
First, on your way to South America,

1163
00:43:34,511 --> 00:43:36,547
