1164
00:43:36,614 --> 00:43:39,650
-For an appetizer…
-Did he make something else?

1165
00:43:39,717 --> 00:43:41,785
…I prepared a beverage.

1166
00:43:41,852 --> 00:43:43,454
I'm sure no one saw me make it.

1167
00:43:43,520 --> 00:43:46,323
You're making this fun
by preparing many things.

1168
00:43:46,390 --> 00:43:50,060
-In the South Pacific, there is…
-The cup is pretty too.

1169
00:43:50,127 --> 00:43:51,662
a beautiful island called Fiji.

1170
00:43:53,497 --> 00:43:55,532
MINERAL WATER
JUST AS REFRESHING AS THAT ISLAND

1171
00:43:55,599 --> 00:43:57,067
-It's from that island.
-Geez.

1172
00:43:58,435 --> 00:43:59,737
SELF-CRINGING

1173
00:43:59,803 --> 00:44:01,705
He can even be funny now.

1174
00:44:01,772 --> 00:44:03,741
Not only is he a good chef,
he's a funny one too.

1175
00:44:03,807 --> 00:44:04,642
Fiji, <i>yareu.</i>

1176
00:44:04,708 --> 00:44:06,210
-<i>Yareu.</i>
-Sure.

1177
00:44:06,844 --> 00:44:08,412
Have some water first.

1178
00:44:09,313 --> 00:44:10,748
All right.

1179
00:44:10,814 --> 00:44:12,249
Then first, the ceviche?

1180
00:44:12,316 --> 00:44:14,418
Yes, the watermelon ceviche first.

1181
00:44:14,485 --> 00:44:15,953
-Watermelon ceviche?
-That sounds good.

1182
00:44:16,020 --> 00:44:19,556
-Isn't it usually made with fish?
-Yes.

1183
00:44:19,623 --> 00:44:20,858
You're right. It's a fish dish.

1184
00:44:20,924 --> 00:44:22,593
Does it come from Peru?

1185
00:44:22,660 --> 00:44:23,761
-Yes, Peru.
-Right?

1186
00:44:23,827 --> 00:44:26,030
-South America, <i>yaho.</i> Let me try it.
-South America, <i>yaho.</i>

1187
00:44:26,096 --> 00:44:29,833
First of all, it's so pretty,
so it makes me feel really great.

1188
00:44:29,900 --> 00:44:32,169
I'm already happy even before trying it.

1189
00:44:32,236 --> 00:44:33,704
-It's good to look at.
-Yes.

1190
00:44:33,771 --> 00:44:35,606
It looks like tuna.

1191
00:44:35,673 --> 00:44:38,308
Tuna or beef.

1192
00:44:38,375 --> 00:44:41,111
-Will she go, "South America, <i>yaho</i>"?
-<i>Yaho.</i>

1193
00:44:41,745 --> 00:44:43,080
YUM

1194
00:44:43,147 --> 00:44:44,348
It looks good.

1195
00:44:44,415 --> 00:44:46,817
A SMILE SPREADS

1196
00:44:48,852 --> 00:44:49,853
Okay?

1197
00:44:50,487 --> 00:44:51,588
Okay, Land?

1198
00:44:51,655 --> 00:44:52,656
Quiet.

1199
00:44:53,323 --> 00:44:54,892
-No talking.
-How scary.

1200
00:44:55,859 --> 00:44:56,860
It's so good.

1201
00:44:58,095 --> 00:45:00,864
It includes every flavor that I love,

1202
00:45:00,931 --> 00:45:02,466
and oddly,

1203
00:45:02,533 --> 00:45:04,835
